What are IT Benchmarking Services?
IT Benchmarking Services provide data-driven comparative analyses assessing technology costs, staffing efficiencies, service levels, and vendor pricing against industry standards. These professional services employ rigorous methodologies to collect, normalize, and analyze metrics across infrastructure, applications, and operations - delivering actionable insights through:

Cost-per-unit benchmarks (servers, support tickets, storage)
Outsourcing rate comparisons
Productivity gap analyses
Performance scorecards
